# Cloudflare Turnstile public site key for the #/join application form.
# Safe to keep here: a Turnstile SITE key is public by design and is meant to appear in
# the page. Its secret counterpart lives in Supabase function secrets as TURNSTILE_SECRET
# and must never appear in this file - anything named VITE_* is compiled into the bundle
# that every visitor downloads.
# While this is empty the form tells applicants it is not set up and refuses to submit,
# and submit-application refuses every request. See RECRUITING.md.
